<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@/~cl_101> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "101" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@> .
