<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@/~cl_113> <https://schema.org/text> "“JADUAL” DENGAN TAJUK “JADUAL PERTAMA”. Jadual baru Kedua, Ketiga dan Keempat"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@/~cl_114> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/20/msa@> .
